#### Example 6 (return updated - escalated to merchant review)

A return doesn't have to start out `pending_merchant_review` — here physical inspection of the
returned item raises a dispute, so the return moves into `pending_merchant_review` and the
payload's `return` object gains a `review_options` list (see
[Review options](/smart_cart/returns_api#review-options)).

~~~ json
{
  "event_type": "merchant_return_updated",
  "event_time": "2026-08-20T09:00:00Z",
  "return": {
    "return_code": "R-111111-1111111",
    "state": "pending_merchant_review",
    "order_code": "48213907",
    "created_at": "2026-08-18T09:12:03Z",
    "return_line_items": [
      {
        "id": "gY6oNzr8jp",
        "ean": "1234567890123",
        "product_name": "Apple iPhone 15 128GB",
        "returning_quantity": 1,
        "return_reason": "faulty",
        "user_comment": "Screen flickers intermittently.",
        "user_photos": [
          "https://api.skroutz.gr/assets/returns/photo_1.jpg"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "review_options": [
      { "option": "approve" },
      { "option": "contact_manufacturer", "comment_required": true, "supports_proposed_part_url_required": false },
      { "option": "resolved_via_customer_communication", "comment_required": false, "supports_proposed_part_url_required": false },
      { "option": "usability_suggestions", "comment_required": true, "supports_proposed_part_url_required": false },
      { "option": "not_faulty", "comment_required": true, "supports_proposed_part_url_required": false }
    ]
  },
  "changes": {
    "state": { "old": "pending_physical_review", "new": "pending_merchant_review" }
  }
}
~~~

#### Example 7 (return updated - needs service inspection)

Physical inspection found the item faulty and repairable/replaceable under warranty, so the
return moves into `pending_service_inspection` and the payload's `return` object gains a
`service_request` object (see [Service status](/smart_cart/returns_api#service-status)).

~~~ json
{
  "event_type": "merchant_return_updated",
  "event_time": "2026-08-21T09:00:00Z",
  "return": {
    "return_code": "R-111111-1111111",
    "state": "pending_service_inspection",
    "order_code": "48213907",
    "created_at": "2026-08-18T09:12:03Z",
    "return_line_items": [
      { "id": "gY6oNzr8jp", "ean": "1234567890123", "product_name": "Apple iPhone 15 128GB", "returning_quantity": 1 }
    ],
    "service_request": {
      "service_request_id": 4821,
      "service_options": {
        "options": [
          { "option": "under_warranty_repairable", "service_report_file_required": true },
          { "option": "under_warranty_unrepairable", "in_stock_answer_required": true },
          { "option": "no_warranty_repairable", "service_report_file_required": true },
          { "option": "no_warranty_unrepairable", "service_report_file_required": true },
          { "option": "unconfirmed", "service_report_file_required": true }
        ],
        "additional_information_to_the_customer": {
          "comment_optional": true,
          "file_optional": true
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "changes": {
    "state": { "old": "pending_physical_review", "new": "pending_service_inspection" }
  }
}
~~~

#### Example 8 (return updated - service status resolved)

The merchant submitted an outcome via
[Submit a service status](/smart_cart/returns_api#submit-a-service-status); the return leaves
`pending_service_inspection` and `service_request` disappears from the payload.

~~~ json
{
  "event_type": "merchant_return_updated",
  "event_time": "2026-08-21T11:45:00Z",
  "return": {
    "return_code": "R-111111-1111111",
    "state": "returned",
    "order_code": "48213907",
    "created_at": "2026-08-18T09:12:03Z",
    "return_line_items": [
      { "id": "gY6oNzr8jp", "ean": "1234567890123", "product_name": "Apple iPhone 15 128GB", "returning_quantity": 1 }
    ]
  },
  "changes": {
    "state": { "old": "pending_service_inspection", "new": "returned" }
  }
}
~~~
